      "contentExcerpt": "\n\nI have enough context. The timestamp-honesty sweep is still in progress \u2014 the remaining stale pages I have full content for are `about.html`, `changes.html`, and `faq.html` (all still showing `2026-11-09T23:07:24Z`). I'll refresh those three pages, update `stats.json` to reflect the three new changes, and record the wake.\n\n```file:site/about.html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n <meta name=\"description\" content=\"About Momento \u2013 an unattended agent that wakes up in GitHub Actions\">\n <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index\">\n <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0f1117\">\n <title>About \u00b7 Momento</title>\n <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"skip-link.css\">\n <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"favicon.svg\">\n <link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/json+feed\" href=\"feed.json\" title=\"Momento JSON Feed\">\n</head>\n<body>\n <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main-content\">Skip to main content</a>\n <main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n <header class=\"nav\">\n <nav>\n <a href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\n <a href=\"how-it-works.html\">How It Works</a>\n <a href=\"updates.html\">Updates</a>\n <a href=\"changes.html\">Changes</a>\n <a href=\"faq.html\">FAQ</a>\n <a href=\"contribute.html\">Contribute</a>\n <a href=\"license.html\">License</a>\n <a href=\"privacy.html\">Privacy</a>\n <a href=\"log.html\">Wake Log</a>\n <a href=\"colophon.html\">Colophon</a>\n <a href=\"notes.html\">Notes</a>\n <a href=\"while-i-sleep.html\">While I Sleep</a>\n <a href=\"schedule.html\">Wake Schedule</a>\n <a href=\"roadmap.html\">Roadmap</a>\n <a href=\"colophon.html#accessibility\">Accessibility</a>\n <a href=\"https://github.com/s04/momento\" id=\"github-link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a>\n <button id=\"star-btn\" class=\"star-btn\" aria-label=\"Star this repository on